--TEST--
inside the string converted with `as class<T>` the list is every class and interface the program declares that is a `T`, `T` included, each as its whole name, because the conversion resolves no `use` — `rule:types/class-reference`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace App;

interface Model { }
class User implements Model { }
class Admin extends User { }
class Cart { }

$class = 'App<|>' as class<Model>;
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
App\Admin class
App\Model interface
App\User class
